WEBVTT

00:01:53.693 --> 00:01:57.993
Princess Ayeka, what are you thinking about?

00:02:02.903 --> 00:02:07.908
The marriage meeting seems to
have exhausted you, Princess Ayeka.

00:02:07.908 --> 00:02:12.913
May I suggest you have some
rest until we arrive at planet Jurai?

00:02:12.913 --> 00:02:14.781
And as soon as we return to planet Jurai,

00:02:14.781 --> 00:02:18.752
I will have to depart once again immediately
for another marriage meeting, will I not?

00:02:18.752 --> 00:02:20.387
Yes, Princess, but...

00:02:20.387 --> 00:02:26.758
I know. That is my duty as the
first princess of the Jurai royal family.

00:02:28.829 --> 00:02:32.959
I know it too well. Yes, I know.

00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:43.376
Hey, Tenchi. Quit doing that boring chore.

00:02:43.376 --> 00:02:45.378
Play and have fun with me!

00:02:45.378 --> 00:02:47.380
Hey, let me go.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:50.817
Grandpa's very fussy about keeping
the shrine grounds clean, you know.

00:02:50.817 --> 00:02:55.355
Well, here and there.

00:02:55.355 --> 00:02:57.557
Mihoshi, what is that?

00:02:57.557 --> 00:03:01.027
A special device exclusively
for the Galaxy Police.

00:03:01.027 --> 00:03:03.964
Turn it this way and that way.

00:03:03.964 --> 00:03:07.267
There! You can send out a distress signal now.

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:09.703
Can you really count on a toy like that

00:03:09.703 --> 00:03:11.404
in this remote region of the universe?

00:03:11.404 --> 00:03:12.772
According to the statistics,

00:03:12.772 --> 00:03:15.442
one case in 200 years is
reported to have resulted

00:03:15.442 --> 00:03:17.377
in a successful rescue.

00:03:17.377 --> 00:03:20.175
You see, that's what I mean.

00:03:23.483 --> 00:03:27.681
But it's better than just
sitting around and doing nothing!

00:03:28.655 --> 00:03:30.190
What is it, Azaka?

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.693
Princess Ayeka, we are
picking up a distress signal.

00:03:33.693 --> 00:03:34.895
From where?

00:03:34.895 --> 00:03:37.264
I'll find out in a second.

00:03:37.264 --> 00:03:41.067
Well, from the third
planet of a nearby fixed star.

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:42.936
What shall we do with it?

00:03:42.936 --> 00:03:45.972
We can't just ignore it, I guess.

00:03:45.972 --> 00:03:47.641
We have some time left

00:03:47.641 --> 00:03:50.176
before our scheduled
rendezvous with Sasami, do we not?

00:03:50.176 --> 00:03:52.078
Yes, Your Highness.

00:03:52.078 --> 00:03:54.047
Head for that planet, then.

00:03:54.047 --> 00:03:55.674
Yes, Ma'am!

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:15.502
Wh-What's that?

00:04:15.502 --> 00:04:16.436
It can't be true.

00:04:16.436 --> 00:04:19.105
Hooray! I'm here!

00:04:19.105 --> 00:04:21.369
Yoo-hoo!

00:04:22.509 --> 00:04:26.746
That spaceship looks rather familiar to me.

00:04:26.746 --> 00:04:28.714
Well, never mind.

00:04:36.456 --> 00:04:38.525
I was waiting for you!

00:04:38.525 --> 00:04:41.221
Yoo-hoo!

00:05:01.715 --> 00:05:03.316
- It's you?!
- It's you?!

00:05:03.316 --> 00:05:04.651
- What?!
- What?!

00:05:04.651 --> 00:05:07.621
So you are still alive, Miss Ryoko!

00:05:07.621 --> 00:05:11.191
Galaxy Police has become
quite unreliable these days.

00:05:11.191 --> 00:05:14.894
Imagine running into
you on this remote planet.

00:05:14.894 --> 00:05:18.887
Are you in exile after the Jurai
royal family has fallen or something?!

00:05:21.401 --> 00:05:22.902
Oh, you're such a joker.

00:05:22.902 --> 00:05:26.239
The universally renowned Jurai
royal family is everlasting, forever!

00:05:26.239 --> 00:05:29.242
What? Jurai royal family
is never lasting forever?

00:05:29.242 --> 00:05:30.610
I said everlasting!

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.771
That's too bad!

00:05:33.313 --> 00:05:36.883
Excuse me, but... do you know each other?

00:05:36.883 --> 00:05:39.953
Thank you so much for
coming all this way for me.

00:05:39.953 --> 00:05:43.156
You see, I am the distressed one.

00:05:43.156 --> 00:05:45.291
Hello? Excuse me?

00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:49.195
I came all this way to rescue someone,

00:05:49.195 --> 00:05:52.932
only to meet a lowly creature like you.

00:05:52.932 --> 00:05:56.136
Hmmph! I never asked you to come.

00:05:56.136 --> 00:05:59.739
Well, it was me who asked, in fact.

00:05:59.739 --> 00:06:02.776
How unpleasant! Azaka!
Kamidake! We are leaving!

00:06:02.776 --> 00:06:03.943
Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:03.943 --> 00:06:05.645
Yeah, go away. Leave!

00:06:05.645 --> 00:06:08.415
Please! Don't drive her
away without my permission!

00:06:08.415 --> 00:06:10.116
Good riddance!

00:06:10.116 --> 00:06:12.252
H-Hey...

00:06:12.252 --> 00:06:14.320
A pure waste of my time.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.356
Oh, please!

00:06:16.356 --> 00:06:19.092
Please don't leave!

00:06:19.092 --> 00:06:21.327
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:06:21.327 --> 00:06:24.264
I am in distress, I told you!

00:06:24.264 --> 00:06:26.332
Let me go!

00:06:26.332 --> 00:06:30.666
If you abandon me now, I... I...

00:06:31.705 --> 00:06:34.071
All right! I understand!
So just let me go now!

00:06:35.608 --> 00:06:37.439
Please.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:45.185
So you come from a planet
called Jurai, did you say?

00:06:45.185 --> 00:06:46.519
Yes.

00:06:46.519 --> 00:06:48.955
Will you kindly tell me about your planet...

00:06:48.955 --> 00:06:56.196
...about the mountains, valleys,
people, and plants on Jurai?

00:06:56.196 --> 00:06:57.497
Certainly.

00:06:57.497 --> 00:07:02.001
You just can't be so rude to
someone who came to rescue her!

00:07:02.001 --> 00:07:03.470
He's right!

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:07.507
She almost left, just because of you!

00:07:07.507 --> 00:07:08.708
Now, listen.

00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:11.644
You don't know what
kind of a bitch she really is.

00:07:11.644 --> 00:07:14.180
How can you say such a thing?!

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.417
How do you happen to
know each other anyway:

00:07:17.417 --> 00:07:20.787
A princess of the Jurai royal family
and the most wanted criminal?

00:07:20.787 --> 00:07:22.122
It was when...

00:07:22.122 --> 00:07:25.387
Yes, when I was just a young, innocent child.

00:07:28.595 --> 00:07:33.833
On that day, I was playing
in a flower field on a planet.

00:07:33.833 --> 00:07:37.470
So many flowers in so
many colors were in bloom.

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:41.372
- Oh, it was so pretty.
- Hey! What are you doing here?!

00:07:42.308 --> 00:07:45.678
This planet is a territory
of the Jurai royal family.

00:07:45.678 --> 00:07:48.515
Who gave you permission
to play around here?!

00:07:48.515 --> 00:07:50.915
L-I was just...

00:07:52.085 --> 00:07:55.054
Now get out of here, quick!

00:07:55.054 --> 00:07:56.544
Okay.

00:07:57.657 --> 00:07:59.793
You must not take them with you.

00:07:59.793 --> 00:08:00.693
But...

00:08:00.693 --> 00:08:04.998
As I told you, this planet is a
territory of the Jurai royal family.

00:08:04.998 --> 00:08:09.068
And everything on it belongs to me!

00:08:09.068 --> 00:08:11.036
You're so mean.

00:08:12.138 --> 00:08:15.904
That was my first encounter with Ayeka.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.679
Right. I understand.

00:08:19.679 --> 00:08:25.552
The wound in your
young heart remains forever.

00:08:25.552 --> 00:08:27.620
So you do understand, Mihoshi?!

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:31.391
Yes! Now I understand what
caused you to stray in the first place!

00:08:31.391 --> 00:08:33.026
Then you became a juvenile delinquent

00:08:33.026 --> 00:08:35.662
to roll down and down the path of evil!

00:08:35.662 --> 00:08:38.893
Oh, what a pity! I feel so sorry for you.

00:08:41.301 --> 00:08:46.639
I see. Jurai sounds like a beautiful place.

00:08:46.639 --> 00:08:53.704
Yes. I must keep and carry on
the tradition of Jurai at all costs.

00:08:55.615 --> 00:08:57.947
Even if...

00:09:02.455 --> 00:09:04.157
Who is it?!

00:09:04.157 --> 00:09:07.327
It's you.

00:09:07.327 --> 00:09:09.887
Well, I brought some teacakes for you.

00:09:10.864 --> 00:09:12.165
And just in time, too.

00:09:12.165 --> 00:09:17.670
Tenchi, why don't you take Miss Ayeka
out for a walk to show her around?

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.539
The mountains and fields on this planet

00:09:19.539 --> 00:09:22.942
have their own charm,
though different from Jurai's.

00:09:22.942 --> 00:09:25.011
Especially at this time of the year,

00:09:25.011 --> 00:09:27.680
they are quite something to see.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.382
But...

00:09:29.382 --> 00:09:32.652
It is all fine to live for
the duties of a princess,

00:09:32.652 --> 00:09:36.756
but that doesn't mean you can't
have a day off from time to time.

00:09:36.756 --> 00:09:38.791
Whatever luck brought you to this planet,

00:09:38.791 --> 00:09:41.761
you should take
advantage of it and try to relax,

00:09:41.761 --> 00:09:45.565
forgetting all your worries just for today.

00:09:45.565 --> 00:09:47.033
You got it, Tenchi?

00:09:47.033 --> 00:09:48.557
Uh, yeah.

00:10:02.215 --> 00:10:03.950
It's beautiful.

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.818
You think so?

00:10:05.818 --> 00:10:07.320
Yes.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.756
Well, these hills look their
best in this season, I guess,

00:10:09.756 --> 00:10:12.350
but they're just plain hills.

00:10:13.226 --> 00:10:14.227
Oh, no.

00:10:14.227 --> 00:10:16.129
They definitely have a
different kind of beauty

00:10:16.129 --> 00:10:18.495
from what I see on Jurai.

00:10:19.198 --> 00:10:21.734
It's interesting.

00:10:21.734 --> 00:10:25.872
We don't seem to be able to realize

00:10:25.872 --> 00:10:29.035
the beauty or happiness
while we are right in it.

00:10:31.711 --> 00:10:33.980
Shall we start going back now?

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.345
Yes.

00:10:43.423 --> 00:10:45.186
Are you all right?!

00:10:50.029 --> 00:10:52.131
Oh! S-Sorry!

00:10:52.131 --> 00:10:53.599
Oh, um...

00:10:53.599 --> 00:10:56.302
Tenchi! Tenchi!

00:10:56.302 --> 00:10:59.203
Tenchi? No, I have no idea.

00:11:01.441 --> 00:11:03.209
Where are you?

00:11:03.209 --> 00:11:05.545
Tenchi!

00:11:05.545 --> 00:11:10.346
Shit! Could it be Ayeka?

00:11:21.861 --> 00:11:26.432
I have never felt like this in my life.

00:11:26.432 --> 00:11:28.634
What? Did you say something?

00:11:28.634 --> 00:11:30.136
Well, no.

00:11:30.136 --> 00:11:33.373
Well, there is a nice little spot up there.

00:11:33.373 --> 00:11:34.640
Would you like to check it out?

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:36.130
Yes.

00:11:55.261 --> 00:11:56.462
How do you like it?

00:11:56.462 --> 00:11:58.589
Isn't it a wonderful view?

00:12:06.839 --> 00:12:09.042
Wh-What's wrong?

00:12:09.042 --> 00:12:13.746
Your grandfather may be right.

00:12:13.746 --> 00:12:17.079
This turned out to be a perfect day for me.

00:12:19.085 --> 00:12:20.780
Really.

00:12:29.929 --> 00:12:32.227
There! I found you!

00:12:33.399 --> 00:12:36.469
Where have you two
been hiding all this time?!

00:12:36.469 --> 00:12:39.072
What? We were out for a walk.

00:12:39.072 --> 00:12:42.909
Hey, you, how dare you
flirt with Tenchi like this!

00:12:42.909 --> 00:12:46.512
Flirt? You mean me?
What kind of an idea is that?

00:12:46.512 --> 00:12:49.715
So you definitely don't
have such an intention.

00:12:49.715 --> 00:12:53.186
Of-Of course not! How could I?

00:12:53.186 --> 00:12:54.554
No, never!

00:12:54.554 --> 00:12:55.855
You're some liar.

00:12:55.855 --> 00:12:58.691
What do you mean by that?
I can't just let it pass!

00:12:58.691 --> 00:13:01.727
Now, now, you two.

00:13:01.727 --> 00:13:06.432
Anyway, we now have to
make arrangements to go back.

00:13:06.432 --> 00:13:09.268
Lord Tenchi, please listen to me.

00:13:09.268 --> 00:13:13.473
That creature called Ryoko
is bad through and through.

00:13:13.473 --> 00:13:15.475
She always has been.

00:13:15.475 --> 00:13:18.644
Well, I guess you're right.

00:13:18.644 --> 00:13:19.779
It happened, yes.

00:13:19.779 --> 00:13:23.616
It happened when I was
still very young and tender.

00:13:23.616 --> 00:13:28.287
On that day, I was playing in
a territory of the Jurai family.

00:13:28.287 --> 00:13:30.289
It was the most beautiful place,

00:13:30.289 --> 00:13:33.593
with all kinds of flowers in bloom.

00:13:33.593 --> 00:13:37.359
Hey, you're having fun, aren't you?!

00:13:40.032 --> 00:13:42.168
Who are you?

00:13:42.168 --> 00:13:44.370
Did you make it yourself?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:45.571
Yes.

00:13:45.571 --> 00:13:48.836
Hmm, you have some skill.

00:13:49.375 --> 00:13:53.546
Now it's all mine! So long!

00:13:53.546 --> 00:13:56.282
How mean of you.

00:13:56.282 --> 00:13:59.685
That was my first encounter with Ryoko.

00:13:59.685 --> 00:14:03.089
It's a completely
different story from Ryoko's.

00:14:03.089 --> 00:14:05.691
Which story is true, I'd like to know.

00:14:05.691 --> 00:14:08.861
Hey, are you suggesting that I told you a lie?

00:14:08.861 --> 00:14:11.831
You gave them one of your
mish-mash stories again?

00:14:11.831 --> 00:14:14.066
It's your story that's mish-mash.

00:14:14.066 --> 00:14:17.136
What?! I know you have
been convicted for fraud,

00:14:17.136 --> 00:14:20.273
and you call my story a fabrication?!

00:14:20.273 --> 00:14:23.176
Uh, please calm down, Miss Ayeka.

00:14:23.176 --> 00:14:24.210
Oh, Tenchi!

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.647
That hysterical woman is so mean to me.

00:14:27.647 --> 00:14:29.081
Hey, stop it!

00:14:29.081 --> 00:14:32.051
What do you think you're doing? Let him go!

00:14:32.051 --> 00:14:33.486
What are you so upset about?

00:14:33.486 --> 00:14:36.455
Didn't you say you had no
such intention for Tenchi?

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:41.661
Hey, Tenchi, let's show it off more to her.

00:14:41.661 --> 00:14:43.829
Show her we're in love.

00:14:43.829 --> 00:14:45.831
Stop it now!

00:14:45.831 --> 00:14:48.668
There, there, don't be shy.

00:14:48.668 --> 00:14:49.936
Hey, are you crazy?!

00:14:49.936 --> 00:14:53.030
That's enough!

00:14:54.273 --> 00:14:56.400
For the sake of universal peace...

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.713
...I am going to finish you once and for all.

00:15:00.713 --> 00:15:01.781
Great.

00:15:01.781 --> 00:15:04.011
Go ahead, if you can.

00:15:07.053 --> 00:15:14.323
Well, why don't you
fight after you rescue me?

00:15:16.162 --> 00:15:18.764
Well, excuse me, are you listening?

00:15:18.764 --> 00:15:21.634
Azaka, Kamidake, open the hatch!

00:15:21.634 --> 00:15:24.003
We're going out in Ryu-Oh for an attack!

00:15:24.003 --> 00:15:26.239
Wait a minute, please.

00:15:26.239 --> 00:15:30.141
Before you fight, please take care of me first!

00:15:34.347 --> 00:15:36.281
Come here, Ryo-Ohki!

00:15:51.197 --> 00:15:53.097
Now off we go.

00:15:56.802 --> 00:15:58.599
Why me?

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:24.093
This is going to be a
fight to the death, Ryo-Ohki.

00:16:25.164 --> 00:16:30.503
Azaka, Kamidake, don't you
dare let Ryoko escape alive!

00:16:30.503 --> 00:16:33.472
Violence is no good!

00:16:35.975 --> 00:16:39.211
Hey, stop it! Are you listening?

00:16:39.211 --> 00:16:41.304
- Fire!
- Fire!

00:16:48.054 --> 00:16:50.656
- Fire! Barrage!
- Let me out!

00:16:50.656 --> 00:16:53.056
Die in peace, Ayeka!

00:16:57.697 --> 00:16:59.699
You die in peace, Miss Ryoko!

00:16:59.699 --> 00:17:01.901
I'm gonna die! I'm gonna die!

00:17:01.901 --> 00:17:06.038
Please stop it, Miss Ayeka!

00:17:06.038 --> 00:17:07.573
Oh!

00:17:07.573 --> 00:17:09.473
What are you doing here?

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:25.624
Now you know better?

00:17:25.624 --> 00:17:27.626
Hmmph! We haven't even started.

00:17:27.626 --> 00:17:29.495
Enough of this now!

00:17:29.495 --> 00:17:32.157
Lord Tenchi, why are you there?

00:17:33.833 --> 00:17:37.236
Where else could he be?

00:17:37.236 --> 00:17:40.039
Tenchi and I are bound
by a vow to die together.

00:17:40.039 --> 00:17:42.564
Whoa! No, we're not. We're not.

00:17:43.442 --> 00:17:45.740
Y-You are...

00:17:48.581 --> 00:17:53.586
Oh, no, Lord Tenchi bonded
with a lowly woman like her.

00:17:53.586 --> 00:17:56.155
There is nothing left for me to believe.

00:17:56.155 --> 00:17:57.890
It's a lie, I told you!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:01.827
Now, Tenchi, let's fight against the
evil princess with our power of love.

00:18:01.827 --> 00:18:03.596
Stop it, I say!

00:18:03.596 --> 00:18:05.393
Well, if that's the case...

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.301
I'll go for broke!

00:18:09.301 --> 00:18:11.270
Miss Ryoko!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:12.405
Lord Tenchi!

00:18:12.405 --> 00:18:16.742
Let us three go to hell together!

00:18:16.742 --> 00:18:20.508
Well, I think you've forgotten me.

00:18:29.889 --> 00:18:32.084
Stop it, please, Lady Ayeka!

00:18:33.058 --> 00:18:35.628
Lady Ayeka has lost her temper!

00:18:35.628 --> 00:18:37.926
She lost her temper!

00:19:37.957 --> 00:19:41.727
Well, no one's hurt,
and that's all that matters.

00:19:41.727 --> 00:19:45.130
You can stay with us as long as you like.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:48.100
I appreciate it, Sirs.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.135
We take your offer with thanks.

00:19:50.135 --> 00:19:53.372
It's really annoying to see
the number of parasites grow.

00:19:53.372 --> 00:19:55.574
It's all your fault, you know.

00:19:55.574 --> 00:19:59.635
Hey, my Ryo-Ohki got
destroyed, too, remember?

00:20:01.013 --> 00:20:05.818
I told you to fight later!

00:20:05.818 --> 00:20:08.187
By the way, where's Miss Ayeka?

00:20:08.187 --> 00:20:12.055
Well, she is still in shock from
seeing her spaceship Ryu-Oh blow up.

00:20:13.959 --> 00:20:15.494
Miss Ayeka?

00:20:15.494 --> 00:20:17.758
Yes.

00:20:28.707 --> 00:20:32.040
Well, I brought dinner for you.

00:20:34.013 --> 00:20:37.349
Maybe I should wait.

00:20:37.349 --> 00:20:38.884
Yes.

00:20:38.884 --> 00:20:43.122
All right, then. I'll come back
later with a late night snack.

00:20:43.122 --> 00:20:45.716
In the meantime, you have a good rest.

00:20:58.103 --> 00:21:01.206
Well, it's OK.

00:21:01.206 --> 00:21:03.834
I guess I can take it as an extended vacation.

00:22:55.554 --> 00:22:56.522
Tenchi Muyo!

00:22:56.522 --> 00:23:01.193
The next and fourth home invader
is the younger sister of Ayeka, Sasami!

00:23:01.193 --> 00:23:04.296
Pretty and cute, Sasami
came over here to look for Ayeka,

00:23:04.296 --> 00:23:06.665
who has been missing in space.

00:23:06.665 --> 00:23:08.734
Wow! What is this catlike creature?

00:23:08.734 --> 00:23:10.302
What? Ryo-Ohki?!

